<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.1pt;"><img src="2509.09372v1/Figures/facon1.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:34/24;" width="34" height="24" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span> 
VLA-Adapter: An Effective Paradigm for Tiny-Scale Vision-Language-Action Model</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
